  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "てらす池に　しずんでいる光りかがやく　結晶の欠けら。お面を　修理するのに　必要らしい。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "태라수호에 가라앉아 있는 반짝반짝 빛나는 결정의 조각. 가면을 수리하는 데 필요하다고 한다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "沉在晶光池裡，閃耀著光輝的結晶碎片。修理面具時似乎需要它。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un morceau de cristal brillant provenant du Lac Cristallin. Il semblerait qu’il soit indispensable à la réparation d’un certain masque.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein Stück der leuchtenden Kristalle vom Grund des Kristallsees. Es wird für die Reparatur der Maske benötigt.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un fragmento de los cristales que refulgen en el fondo del Lago Cristalino. Por lo visto es uno de los materiales necesarios para reparar la máscara.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Pezzo di uno dei cristalli che brillano sul fondo del Lago Cristallìo. Pare che serva per riparare una maschera.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A cluster of the crystals found within the Crystal Pool. They sparkle brilliantly and are apparently necessary to repair a certain mask.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "てらす池に　しずんでいる光りかがやく　結晶の欠けら。お面を　修理するのに　必要らしい。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "沉在晶光池池底并闪闪发光的结晶碎片。修理面具时似乎需要用到。",
